### Variables
### Replace {{token}} with your Clerk session token.
### In the browser console after signing in: await window.Clerk?.session?.getToken()
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_CLERK_TOKEN

### Get news feed (all categories)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/feed?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get news feed by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/feed?limit=50&category=african-business
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generate a video from a news item
POST {{baseUrl}}/videos/generate?newsItemId=YOUR_NEWS_ITEM_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List generated videos
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get video status
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos/YOUR_VIDEO_ID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
